# Deny-by-default: every Dockerfile in this repo builds a Maven service, so the
# context is limited to what the reactor needs. Keeps Render builds from shipping
# the 2.8GB web workspace and node_modules trees over the wire.
*

!pom.xml
!mvnw
!.mvn/
!config/
!services/
!tests/

services/**/target
**/.DS_Store
**/*.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.example
